(text "USB power source in U1" (at 25.4 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c52cac0-424d-5738-beb4-b36de9a80e9c"))
(text "OLED: second tier OVER WeMos; tall 1x4 socket\nFront view, left to right: 1 GND, 2 VCC, 3 SCL, 4 SDA\nVCC = 3.3V from U1; reference envelope 27 x 27 x 3.5mm" (at 129.54 105.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a0a5edd4-495c-53e2-8021-089215d88664"))
(text "J2: RJ-10 / 4P4C PCB-mounted socket\n1: +5V_USB   2: GND   4: SENSOR_SIG to U1.A0\n3: reserved / unused on carrier" (at 203.2 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29b0c7c2-5640-5afc-b036-f4b49ca5187e"))
(text "MECHANICAL CHECKS BEFORE FABRICATION\n1. Type-C WeMos header fit and OLED header pitch/offset\n2. Actual RJ-10 jack versus selected EVERCOM family\n3. Elevated socket mating height and RF clearance" (at 20.32 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "183dd363-acce-5fa6-bb45-cfaaa0f11fde"))
(text "PCB intent: B.Cu only; through-hole assembly\nNo external analog conditioning, per user requirement\nRJ-10 pin 3 and unused MCU pins are NC; no ERC exclusions" (at 157.48 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b2c24d38-a577-526f-8774-3bcf025bc16d"))
